---
import { REPO_URL } from '../lib/release'
---

<section class="free" aria-labelledby="free-title">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="head">
      <h2 id="free-title">Free, and staying that way.</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Paying every month to change the three letters after a dot was always a strange deal. Asteria is free, with no account,
        no ads and no limit on how many files you convert.
      </p>
    </div>
    <dl>
      <div>
        <dt>Nothing is uploaded</dt>
        <dd>
          Your files stay on your computer, and Asteria works offline. The only time it goes online is to download a free add-on
          you said yes to, from the address it shows you first.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Your originals stay as they were</dt>
        <dd>Results are saved as new files, next to the originals or in a folder you pick. Nothing is ever written over a file you already have.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Nothing to sign up for</dt>
        <dd>No account, no email address, no trial that runs out, nothing to cancel.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Open source</dt>
        <dd>
          The code is <a href={REPO_URL}>on GitHub</a> under the MIT license, along with a test that checks converting a file never
          opens a network connection.
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .free {
    padding-block: clamp(64px, 10vw, 120px);
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr);
    gap: 48px clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .head {
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
    position: sticky;
    top: 32px;
  }
  dl {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  dl > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 3fr);
    gap: 8px 32px;
    padding: 24px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  dt {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    max-width: 46ch;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .head {
      position: static;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    dl > div {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
